 - https://github.com/SlimeVR/SlimeVR-Tracker-nRF-PCB
 - https://oshwlab.com/sctanf/slimenrf3
 
+## UART tracking output (mod)
+Build `promicro_uf2/nrf52840/stackedspiuart` (ProMicro, stacked SPI module) to also send every tracker packet over UART.
+
+- TX on **P0.29**, 460800 baud 8N1, TX only (pin and baud are set in `promicro_uf2_stackedspiuart.dts`)
+- Frame: `0xA5 0x5A <len=21>`, then the same payload sent over ESB: 16 byte packet, CRC32-K/4.2 (LE), sequence number
+- A device address packet (type 255) is sent every second
+- ESB still works as normal, set `CONFIG_CONNECTION_UART_ONLY=y` to disable it
+- Decode on a PC with `python3 tools/uart_tracking_decode.py <port>`
+
+Other boards can enable it with `CONFIG_CONNECTION_OVER_UART=y` and a `slimenrf,tracking-uart` chosen node.
+
